                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Item (1) is ISTC ig00036000.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">First recorded in the Supplement, with location
                        untraced and it stated that (2) was detached and appeared at Sotheby's,
                        London, 14 November 1918, lot 751 (sold to Ellis). Both printings, however,
                        are recorded as now being in the Countway Library.</note>
                  </msItem>
